ies that focuses on a number of societal failings. Magic and the fall of the USA has lead to the formation of a coalition of kingdoms loosely organized into the Royal States of America. The stronger a person's magic, the higher their caste is, and the monarchs have the most powerful magic of all. Those without any magic are considered to be the lowest of lows and are treated abominably. This series focuses on many human rights issues. I was sure I was going to hate it but, instead, I freakin' love it! If you are expecting high literature, give this a miss, but if you need some good, old fashioned escape, Susan Copperfield is a great investment of your time.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AGZC53OLHSNRA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.9ToLGiEW2EOWdw8y\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:97114265":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":97114265,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1684889659i/97114265.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":37,"name":"Kheri","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/97114265-kheri","contributor":null,"id":97114265},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2FY3HKWRUVDY5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2FY3HKWRUVDY5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2FY3HKWRUVDY5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.uz1jxOur_-iDqAPQTE19zA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2FY3HKWRUVDY5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2FY3HKWRUVDY5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.uz1jxOur_-iDqAPQTE19zA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.uz1jxOur_-iDqAPQTE19zA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.